            <note corresp="#d283-f3" n="3" xml:id="d283-f3-content">
                <p>According to telegram 333 from Jidda, January 21, it appeared that by the time
                        Jungers and Yamani met in Madrid, the highest levels of
                        ARAMCO “may have known for more than a
                    week that oil deliveries agreement derailed.” (National Archives, Nixon Presidential Materials, NSC Files, Box 631, Country Files, Middle East,
                    Saudi Arabia, Vol. V)</p>
            </note>
